 {"sec": "JDM diagnosis and treatment · p227", "page": 227, "q": "True or False — The essential criterion for the diagnosis of JDM is the characteristic rash.", "opts": ["True", "False"], "ans": 0, "exp": "True — rash (heliotrope rash and Gottron's papules) is the essential criterion; three of four other criteria are additionally required. (Book p227)", "type": "tf", "id": "PEDS-C49-035"},
